      "filename": "The Passmore Edwards Library, Whitechapel - geograph.org.uk - 1277793.jpg",
      "title": "File:The Passmore Edwards Library, Whitechapel - geograph.org.uk - 1277793.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/60/The_Passmore_Edwards_Library%2C_Whitechapel_-_geograph.org.uk_-_1277793.jpg",
